  "question": {
    "text": "<p>As shown in the figure, a particle is moving with constant speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. Considering its motion from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>, the magnitude of the average velocity is:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/63cca49b-301b-41b7-98a1-c56f276f5a37-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 165px;\" /></p>",
